{"id":"vod_sn_38688","vodId":"38688","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"地上最炯新娘","name_cn":"地上最炯新娘","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ec0fff54f6130abb62baa023d51c3436.jpg"},"summary":"虽然犬冢孝士（高桥广树 配音）出生在武术之家，但他本人却是个绝对反对暴力的人士。某一日，一个粉色头发的可爱少女出现在了他的面前，并且自称是他的……未婚妻？原来，少女名叫九头龙桃子（鹿野优以 配音），由于曾经被孝士出手相救过，所以认定了孝士是世间的第一高手，从而许下了要和他生养世上最强孩子的愿望。桃子的热情奔放让孝士防不胜防，但在打闹之间，孝士也开始在意起了这个奇怪的女孩。　　除了桃子之外，外表柔弱内心强悍的中慈马早苗（平野绫 配音），个头矮小却功夫高强的巳屋本色羽（宫崎羽衣 配音）等女孩子们，在一时间居然都以孝士为目标而发起了猛烈攻势。而逐渐的，孝士发现自己貌似被卷入了一场复杂的争斗之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EGYcqy8ET71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XWMUgzP3H71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YAB7RRi8gE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q7vDCQ0Q4W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J2Buu5nL9Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b03G4hJzwh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c7D5K5TXJG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JJGnfiTt481/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NyZhS66TrV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZautmLNeb41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cZyF4r6xFF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QQJ0Wg20vq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f8pYcyS70S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R1hJpLGXxH1/video/index.m3u8"},